--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 如何做好一枚好的销售
Segment #2   [00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:02,600] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 那你得先问自己
Segment #3   [00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,660] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 你为什么要做销售
Segment #4   [00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,460] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 你从销售为了
Segment #5   [00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,440] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 你拿销售当然
Segment #6   [00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,280] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 它才是一个工作
Segment #7   [00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,760] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 只是你一个专情养家的工具
Segment #8   [00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,760] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 那你一定做过销售
Segment #9   [00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,960] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 你去拜访的每一个客户
Segment #10  [00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,240] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说你是为了卖东西
Segment #11  [00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,460] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 你永远做不了一个好的销售
Segment #12  [00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,580] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 你没可能把东西卖上去
Segment #13  [00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,360] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就记住这句话
Segment #14  [00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,780] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 不销售就是犯罪
Segment #15  [00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,320] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 我今天还去找任何一个客户
Segment #16  [00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,360] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 我来我就是卖你东西
Segment #17  [00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,060] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 你必须买
Segment #18  [00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,100] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 你不买我都跟你贵一样
Segment #19  [00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,040] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 你不买我包了你大腿
Segment #20  [00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:21,740] | Elapsed:  16.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不买我帮你走
Segment #21  [00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,600] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 10 | Text: 当然你不能去做一些极端动作
Segment #22  [00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,580] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 14 | Text: 就用去硬额你都在把东西卖上去
Segment #23  [00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,600] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是销售
Segment #24  [00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,400] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个好的销售
Segment #25  [00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,440] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 7  | Text: 第一个能力叫自信
Segment #26  [00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,520] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 相信自己的产品
Segment #27  [00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:30,500] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 能给别人带来改变
Segment #28  [00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,140] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 9  | Text: 相信自己的产品能够作用
Segment #29  [00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:32,980] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 你比如客户问你
Segment #30  [00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:33,160] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 1  | Text: 哎
Segment #31  [00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,160] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 9  | Text: 要不然你的产品有用吗
Segment #32  [00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,280] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 说可能有用吗
Segment #33  [00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,160] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 好了客户不出卖
Segment #34  [00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,540] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 你像我们做培训一样
Segment #35  [00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,320] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 我的培训不够
Segment #36  [00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,860] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 12 | Text: 我感觉都是在改变一个人的命运
Segment #37  [00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,180] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个人他又不来听我的培训
Segment #38  [00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,100] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 他真的错过
Segment #39  [00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:43,660] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 他这一声
Segment #40  [00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,760] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 11 | Text: 你看我的眼神和神态和我的感觉
Segment #41  [00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,720] | Elapsed:  37.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 我是真情流露的
Segment #42  [00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:47,640] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 发自内心的
Segment #43  [00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,980] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 7  | Text: 觉得我的产品非常牛逼
Segment #44  [00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,600] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 而且我们是整个培训行业
Segment #45  [00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,180] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 11 | Text: 目前来讲唯一一脚发钱来的
Segment #46  [00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,020] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 别人是什么
Segment #47  [00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,100] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 是讲把很多的钱
Segment #48  [00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:54,980] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 7  | Text: 装到自己的口袋了
Segment #49  [00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:56,240] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 你要相信自己的产品
Segment #50  [00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:56,960] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 3  | Text: 你要相信自己
Segment #51  [00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,000] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要相信你的公司
Segment #52  [00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:58,800] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 能帮你赚到钱
Segment #53  [00:00:58,800 --> 00:00:59,860] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 能让你赚到钱
Segment #54  [00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,860] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 12 | Text: 你要相信你追随的老百姓牛逼的
Segment #55  [00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:02,880] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要相信你的产品
Segment #56  [00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,540] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 相信你的客户会买你的东西
Segment #57  [00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,420] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 第一个就是自信
Segment #58  [00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:07,300] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 第二个是不要连死产卖达
Segment #59  [00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:08,040] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 是消除精神
Segment #60  [00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:08,860] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 3  | Text: 第三个是
Segment #61  [00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:11,040] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 第三个是被拒绝一千次
Segment #62  [00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:11,820] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就牛逼的
Segment #63  [00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:12,620] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 3  | Text: 第一自信
Segment #64  [00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:13,840] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 我是对牛逼的
Segment #65  [00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,500] | Elapsed:  57.38s | Words: 2  | Text: 第二相信
Segment #66  [00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:15,840] | Elapsed:  63.07s | Words: 7  | Text: 第三被拒绝多人可以
